{"schemaVersion":1,"sourceRecord":{"schemaVersion":1,"recordId":"wikibooks-420644-r4511089","sourceId":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa","sourceTitle":"Cookbook:Strawberry Daiquiri","sourcePageId":420644,"sourceRevision":"4511089","sourceRevisionTimestamp":"2025-06-17T14:13:49Z","sourceRevisionUser":"Kittycataclysm","sourceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/w/index.php?title=Cookbook:Strawberry%20Daiquiri&oldid=4511089","retrievedAt":"2026-10-13T16:17:47.869Z","sourceCategories":["Category:Recipes","Category:Recipes for cocktails","Category:Recipes using lime juice","Category:Recipes using powdered sugar","Category:Recipes using strawberry","Category:Recipes using whipped cream","Category:Recipes with images","Category:Recipes without cooking time","Category:Recipes without servings","Category:Very Easy recipes"],"license":{"id":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa-4.0","name":"Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-SA 4.0); Wikibooks text is generally dual-licensed with GFDL unless otherwise noted","evidenceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/wiki/Wikibooks:Copyrights","policyStatus":"verified-license","pageExceptionStatus":"not-reviewed-per-page","attribution":"Attribute Wikibooks contributors by linking each version-specific source page. Indicate that structured fields are extracted and any translated or edited text is modified. Include CC BY-SA 4.0 notice/link and share adaptations under CC BY-SA 4.0 or later.","changeNoticeRequired":true,"shareAlikeRequired":true},"sourceSha256":"d49e4e64114d3af64106c206c7ad389ad72e5303be727a5f9759bef3a05bda0c","sourceWikitext":"{{Recipe summary\n| Category = Cocktail recipes\n| Difficulty = 1\n| Image = [[File:Strawberry daiquiri (8324605355).jpg|300px]]\n}}\n\n{{recipe}}\n\nThe '''strawberry daiquiri''' is a [[Cookbook:Cocktail|cocktail]] composed mainly of [[Cookbook:Rum|rum]], schnapps, and strawberries. It can be shaken or puréed in a blender for a smooth consistency.\n\n== Ingredients ==\n* [[Cookbook:Strawberry|Strawberry]] juice, for rim\n*[[Cookbook:Sugar|Sugar]], for rim\n*1 [[Cookbook:Ounce|oz]] light [[Cookbook:Rum|rum]]\n* ½ oz strawberry [[Cookbook:Schnapps|schnapps]]\n* 1 oz [[Cookbook:Lime|lime]] juice\n* 2 [[Cookbook:Teaspoon|tsp]] [[Cookbook:Powdered Sugar|powdered sugar]]\n* 2 oz fresh or frozen [[Cookbook:Strawberry|strawberries]]\n* Crushed ice\n*[[Cookbook:Whipped Cream|Whipped cream]], for garnish\n*Fresh strawberry, for garnish\n\n== Procedure ==\n# Rim a glass in strawberry juice and sugar.\n# Shake rum, schnapps, lime juice, powdered sugar, strawberries, and crushed ice in a [[Cookbook:Cocktail Shaker|cocktail shaker]].\n# Pour into the rimmed glass.\n# Garnish with whipped cream and a whole fresh strawberry.\n# Serve.\n\n[[Category:Recipes using whipped cream]]\n[[Category:Recipes for cocktails]]\n[[Category:Recipes using strawberry]]\n[[Category:Recipes using powdered sugar]]\n[[Category:Recipes using lime juice]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Strawberry Daiquiri","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":null,"ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"Strawberry juice, for rim","sourceText":"Strawberry juice, for rim","amountText":"Strawberry juice, for rim","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-2","name":"Sugar, for rim","sourceText":"Sugar, for rim","amountText":"Sugar, for rim","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-3","name":"1 oz light rum","sourceText":"1 oz light rum","amountText":"1 oz light rum","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-4","name":"½ oz strawberry schnapps","sourceText":"½ oz strawberry schnapps","amountText":"½ oz strawberry schnapps","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-5","name":"1 oz lime juice","sourceText":"1 oz lime juice","amountText":"1 oz lime juice","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-6","name":"2 tsp powdered sugar","sourceText":"2 tsp powdered sugar","amountText":"2 tsp p